data: {"id":"chatcmpl-d2ab1f3d-b0bc-4e9e-b044-9db613c1a9d3","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1779180859,"model":"x","usage":null,"choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"## Existence + parent function group (via `SearchObject`)\n- `ZMEDI_GET_FROM_SFTP` exists (`FUGR/FF`), package `Z001`\n- `ZMEDI_PUT_FROM_SFTP` exists (`FUGR/FF`), package `Z001`\n\nBoth belong to function group **`ZMEDICARE`** (confirmed when reading the FM sources).\n\n## Parent function group read (via `ReadFunctionGroup`)\nFunction group read: **`ZMEDICARE`** (active). *(The `ReadFunctionGroup` payload returned only FG metadata XML, not ABAP include contents.)*\n\n---\n\n## Function module bodies (verbatim)\n\n### `ZMEDI_GET_FROM_SFTP`\n```abap\nFUNCTION zmedi_get_from_sftp\r\n  IMPORTING\r\n    command TYPE sxpgcolist-name\r\n    constants TYPE bdc_prog\r\n  TABLES\r\n    return LIKE bapiret2 OPTIONAL.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  DATA:\r\n    lv_ret_code TYPE extcmdexex-exitcode,\r\n    lv_comm     TYPE  sxpgcolist-name,\r\n    lt_return   TYPE TABLE OF btcxpm WITH HEADER LINE.\r\n\r\n  REFRESH: gt_constants, gt_log.\r\n  CLEAR: gv_file, gv_ind.\r\n  SELECT * FROM zfi_constants INTO TABLE gt_constants\r\n                              WHERE pname = constants.\r\n  lv_comm = command.\r\n\r\n  IF NOT gt_constants[] IS INITIAL.\r\n    PERFORM f_set_parameter USING 'FTP_USER'          'M' ''.\r\n    PERFORM f_set_parameter USING 'PASSPHRASE'        'M' ':'.\r\n    PERFORM f_set_parameter USING 'HOST_KEY'          'M' ';'.\r\n    PERFORM f_set_parameter USING 'FTP_DOMAIN'        'M' ';'.\r\n    PERFORM f_set_parameter USING 'PRIVATE_KEY_PATH'  'M' ';'.\r\n    PERFORM f_set_parameter USING 'SFTP_FILE_EXT'     'M' ';'.\r\n    PERFORM f_set_parameter USING 'SOURCE_PATH'       'M' ';'.\r\n    PERFORM f_set_parameter USING 'SOURCE_FOLDER'     'M' ''.\r\n    PERFORM f_set_parameter USING 'ECS_FILE_EXT'      'M' ';'.\r\n    PERFORM f_set_parameter USING 'ZDEST_FOLD'        'M' ';'.\r\n  ENDIF.\r\n\r\n\r\n  CALL FUNCTION 'SXPG_COMMAND_EXECUTE'\r\n    EXPORTING\r\n      commandname                   = lv_comm\r\n      additional_parameters         = gv_param\r\n    IMPORTING\r\n      exitcode                      = lv_ret_code\r\n    TABLES\r\n      exec_protocol                 = lt_return[]\r\n    EXCEPTIONS\r\n      no_permission                 = 1\r\n      command_not_found             = 2\r\n      parameters_too_long           = 3\r\n      security_risk                 = 4\r\n      wrong_check_call_interface    = 5\r\n      program_start_error           = 6\r\n      program_termination_error     = 7\r\n      x_error                       = 8\r\n      parameter_expected            = 9\r\n      too_many_parameters           = 10\r\n      illegal_command               = 11\r\n      wrong_asynchronous_parameters = 12\r\n      cant_enq_tbtco_entry          = 13\r\n      jobcount_generation_error     = 14\r\n      OTHERS                        = 15.\r\n  IF sy-subrc = 0.\r\n    CLEAR:gv_param.\r\n  ENDIF.\r\n\r\n  IF gt_log[] IS NOT INITIAL.\r\n    return[] = gt_log[].\r\n  ENDIF.\r\n\r\nENDFUNCTION.\n```\n\n### `ZMEDI_PUT_FROM_SFTP`\n```abap\nFUNCTION zmedi_put_from_sftp\r\n  IMPORTING\r\n    command TYPE sxpgcolist-name\r\n    constants TYPE bdc_prog\r\n  TABLES\r\n    return LIKE bapiret2 OPTIONAL.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  DATA:\r\n    lv_ret_code TYPE extcmdexex-exitcode,\r\n    lv_comm     TYPE  sxpgcolist-name VALUE 'ZSFTP_MEDICARE_PUT',\r\n    lt_return   TYPE TABLE OF btcxpm WITH HEADER LINE,\r\n    lv_value    TYPE string,\r\n    lv_status   TYPE btcxpgstat,\r\n    g_ret_code  TYPE extcmdexex-exitcode.\r\n\r\n  REFRESH: gt_constants.\r\n  CLEAR: gv_file, gv_ind.\r\n  SELECT * FROM zfi_constants INTO TABLE gt_constants\r\n                              WHERE pname = constants.\r\n  lv_comm = command.\r\n\r\n  IF NOT gt_constants[] IS INITIAL.\r\n    PERFORM f_set_parameter_out USING 'FTP_USER'          'M' ''   CHANGING lv_value.\r\n    PERFORM f_set_parameter_out USING 'PASSPHRASE'        'M' ':'  CHANGING lv_value.\r\n    PERFORM f_set_parameter_out USING 'HOST_KEY'          'M' ';'  CHANGING lv_value.\r\n    PERFORM f_set_parameter_out USING 'FTP_DOMAIN'        'M' ';'  CHANGING lv_value.\r\n    PERFORM f_set_parameter_out USING 'SOURCE_FOLDER'     'M' ';'  CHANGING lv_value.\r\n    PERFORM f_set_parameter_out USING 'ZDEST_FOLD'        'M' ';'  CHANGING lv_value.\r\n  ENDIF.\r\n\r\n  CALL FUNCTION 'SXPG_COMMAND_EXECUTE'\r\n    EXPORTING\r\n      commandname                   = lv_comm\r\n      additional_parameters         = gv_param\r\n    IMPORTING\r\n      status                        = lv_status\r\n      exitcode                      = g_ret_code\r\n    TABLES\r\n      exec_protocol                 = lt_return[]\r\n    EXCEPTIONS\r\n      no_permission                 = 1\r\n      command_not_found             = 2\r\n      parameters_too_long           = 3\r\n      security_risk                 = 4\r\n      wrong_check_call_interface    = 5\r\n      program_start_error           = 6\r\n      program_termination_error     = 7\r\n      x_error                       = 8\r\n      parameter_expected            = 9\r\n      too_many_parameters           = 10\r\n      illegal_command               = 11\r\n      wrong_asynchronous_parameters = 12\r\n      cant_enq_tbtco_entry          = 13\r\n      jobcount_generation_error     = 14\r\n      OTHERS                        = 15.\r\n\r\n  IF gt_log[] IS NOT INITIAL.\r\n    return[] = gt_log[].\r\n  ENDIF.\r\n\r\n\r\nENDFUNCTION.\n```\n\n---\n\n## Focused question: do these FMs call `SXPG_COMMAND_EXECUTE` or use a different SFTP mechanism?\nThey **do call `SXPG_COMMAND_EXECUTE`** (SM69 external command execution), i.e. legacy OS-level command execution rather than a native ABAP SFTP client.\n\nCited lines from the FM sources:\n- In `ZMEDI_GET_FROM_SFTP`:\n  - `CALL FUNCTION 'SXPG_COMMAND_EXECUTE'`\n  - `commandname = lv_comm`\n  - `additional_parameters = gv_param`\n- In `ZMEDI_PUT_FROM_SFTP`:\n  - `CALL FUNCTION 'SXPG_COMMAND_EXECUTE'`\n  - `commandname = lv_comm`\n  - `additional_parameters = gv_param`\n\nNo evidence in these FM bodies of native ABAP SSH/SFTP classes, HTTP gateway calls, or `CALL 'SYSTEM'`; the only execution mechanism shown is `SXPG_COMMAND_EXECUTE`."},"finish_reason":null}]}

